<p style="color: green"><%%= notice %></p>

<h1>Save your recovery codes</h1>

<p><strong>This is the only time these will be shown.</strong> Each one signs you in
once if you lose your authenticator app, so store them somewhere safe.</p>

<ul>
  <%% @codes.each do |code| %>
    <li><code><%%= code %></code></li>
  <%% end %>
</ul>

<p><%%= button_to "I've saved them", complete_<%= identity.settings_helper_prefix %>_mfa_recovery_codes_path, method: :post %></p>
